chx:X_MacHomebrew a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:MacHomebrew ; rdfs:label "shutil.which('brew')"@en ; skos:definition "On macOS Homebrew installs the engine with brew install tesseract, usually into /opt/homebrew/bin; here brew is not found, /opt/homebrew does not exist and pointing tesseract_cmd there raises TesseractNotFoundError."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch22/research> .
