chx:X_CharacterErrorRate a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:CharacterErrorRate ; rdfs:label "cer('abcd', 'abxd')"@en ; skos:definition "The character error rate is the edit distance divided by the length of the reference after white space is normalised: abcd against abxd is 0.25, an empty reading is 1.0 and a longer reading is 1.0 for abcd against abcdefgh."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch22/research> .
