chx:X_WhiteOnBlack a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:WhiteOnBlack ; rdfs:label "tessedit_do_invert=0"@en ; skos:definition "White text on black read with a character error rate of 0.0116 by default, 1.0965 with -c tessedit_do_invert=0, and 0.0116 again when the picture is inverted first (MEASURED single runs with the Tesseract version 5.3.4), so the engine inverts by itself unless told not to."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch22/research> .
