chx:X_PsmModes a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:PsmModes ; rdfs:label "config='--psm 6'"@en ; skos:definition "On a six line paragraph the page segmentation modes 3, 4, 6 and 11 returned 6 lines with a character error rate of 0.0116 while 7 and 13 returned 1 line with 0.9923 and 0.9961 (MEASURED single runs with the Tesseract version 5.3.4)."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch22/research> .
