chx:X_UserDefinedDpi a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:UserDefinedDpi ; rdfs:label "-c user_defined_dpi=300"@en ; skos:definition "A generated image carries no dpi (im.info.get('dpi') is None); for 9 pixel text the error rate was 0.0579 by default and with user_defined_dpi=70 and 0.7452 with 300 (MEASURED single runs with the Tesseract version 5.3.4)."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch22/research> .
