chx:X_NapsCommand a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:NapsCommand ; rdfs:label "naps2 console -i frankenstein.png -o output.pdf"@en ; skos:definition "The command naps2 console -i frankenstein.png -o output.pdf --install ocr-eng --ocrlang eng -n 0 -f -v returned 0 and a 1 page PDF whose text read with a character error rate of 0.0035 (MEASURED single runs with the Tesseract version 5.3.4)."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch22/research> .
