chx:X_OcrmypdfRoute a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:OcrmypdfRoute ; rdfs:label "ocrmypdf --image-dpi 150 in.png out.pdf"@en ; skos:definition "ocrmypdf 17.13.0 exits with 2 and writes nothing for an image without a dpi, with --image-dpi 150 it exits 0 and the text reads with an error rate of 0.0035, and a file that already has text exits 6 unless --skip-text is given (MEASURED single runs with the Tesseract version 5.3.4)."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch22/research> .
